<title>GREECE: GREEK NATL BANK GOVERNOR NEWS CONF AT 1300 LOCAL.</title>
<headline>GREEK NATL BANK GOVERNOR NEWS CONF AT 1300 LOCAL.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Bank of Greece Governor Theodore Karatzas will hold a press conference today at 1300 local, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Karatzas is expected to announce the corporate results of Greece's largest commercial bank and outline its strategy for 1997 and beyond.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
